Error handling:
To handle cases where the file might be malformed or incomplete, this function includes error handling to gracefully report any errors that may occur during the execution of the program. This includes checking for errors when opening the file, reading entries from the file, and processing each entry in the array. Additionally, it also includes error handling to handle invalid entries (non-numeric values) as errors and continue processing subsequent entries.']

