The `manage_list` function also includes functionality to filter and sort the list based on signal strength and UE_ID, using a custom algorithm tailored to the specific characteristics of the `LTE_PHY_RX_STRUCT` data structure. This allows for efficient filtering and sorting operations even as the list grows in size.

